# rp2350-touch-lcd-28-platform

The Waveshare RP2350-Touch-LCD-2.8 composite board and the four board-owned
providers it binds: an ST7789 colour panel, a CST328 touch controller, a
QMI8658 inertial sensor, and a PCF85063 clock.

Each provider owns its own wiring and nothing else. The device drivers are
portable modules under modules/mm, and the board is the only place that knows
which pin is which.
